# Zoo Skills (Auto-Invoked)

All skills in `.cursor/skills/zoo-*/` are **model-invoked**. When a task matches a skill description, read and follow that skill immediately. Re-sync: `node scripts/sync-zoo-skills-to-cursor.mjs`.

## Intent → skill (auto-load)

| User intent | Skill |
|-------------|-------|
| Small fix, tweak, CSS change | `zoo-tweak` |
| Test-first, TDD, red-green | `zoo-tdd` |
| Behavior scenarios, Gherkin | `zoo-bdd` |
| Acceptance criteria first | `zoo-atdd` |
| Component from primitives | `zoo-cdd` |
| Web page, site, theme, colors, styling, UI design | `zoo-theme-sandbox` |
| Bug, debug, broken, failing | `zoo-diagnosing-bugs` |
| New feature, PRD, planning | `zoo-grill-with-docs`, `zoo-to-spec`, `zoo-to-tickets` |
| Refactor, architecture | `zoo-improve-codebase-architecture` |
| Explore, unfamiliar code | `zoo-explore` |
| Verify, run tests, lint, build | `zoo-verify` |
| Review diff, PR, branch | `zoo-code-review` |
| Commit, journal, document | `zoo-commit-and-document` |
| Domain modeling, entities | `zoo-ddd`, `zoo-domain-modeling` |
| API contract first | `zoo-api-first` |
| Triage issues | `zoo-triage` |
| Munger, decision quality | `zoo-munger-perspective` |
| Handoff document | `zoo-handoff` |
| Prototype, spike | `zoo-prototype` |
| Update docs | `zoo-update-docs` |
| Multi-session mapping | `zoo-wayfinder` |

Full manifest: `.cursor/skills/zoo-skills-manifest.json`

## Helper skills (auto-invoked by other skills)

`zoo-grilling`, `zoo-domain-modeling`, `zoo-codebase-design`

## Protocol

1. Match intent → read skill `SKILL.md` fully
2. Read linked reference files only when directed
3. Follow all `zoo-*.mdc` mandates alongside the skill
4. Never ask user to invoke via slash command
